OL,3,GNEWSADate for tips booking system after
OL,4,Atraffic jams
OL,5,
OL,6,FA booking system for Lincolnshire's
OL,7,Frecycling centres will go live in
OL,8,FNovember, the council has said.
OL,10,FLincolnshire County Council said it
OL,11,Fhoped the new system would deal with
OL,12,Fqueues at the county's 11 tips and
OL,13,Ftackle misuse of the facilities.
OL,15,FThe authority said people would be able
OL,16,Fto book on the day, with alternative
OL,17,Fbooking options available for residents
OL,18,Fwho are unable to access digital
OL,19,Fservices.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
