OL,3,GNEWSADate for tips booking system after
OL,4,Atraffic jams
OL,5,
OL,6,FDanny Brookes, the council's executive
OL,7,Ffor the environment, said the system
OL,8,Fwould "reduce congestion, improve site
OL,9,Fsafety, tackle misuse by non-residents
OL,10,Fand commercial operators, and support
OL,11,Fbetter recycling performance".
